# ShopSphere Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# Leave empty or unset. In development (npm start), Create React App
# proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000 automatically.
#
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT (e.g. Vercel):
# Set this in your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://your-backend-app.onrender.com/api
